=== Episode 1: Cakes ===
For the first challenge, the bakers were instructed to make a cake using fresh fruit, with no dried fruit permitted, in 2 hours. For the technical challenge, the bakers were instructed to make 12 chocolate [[Swiss roll|mini rolls]] using Prue Leith's recipe which contains [[peppermint]] cream, in 2 hours. The showstopper challenge required the bakers to make an illusion cake: a cake that appears to be some other object. They had 4 hours to complete the task.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
