=== Episode 2: Biscuits ===
For the signature challenge, the bakers were instructed to make 24 [[sandwich cookie|sandwich biscuits]] in 2 hours and 15 minutes. For the technical challenge, the bakers faced a very difficult challenge of making 12 [[fortune cookie]]s of 2 types of flavours – 6 almond and 6 orange, in 2 hours. For the final showstopper challenge, the bakers were required to make a biscuit [[board game]] that should be at least {{convert|40|cm|in|abbr=on}} long in diameter and has at least eight elements in {{frac|3|1|2}} hours.<ref>{{cite web|url= https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/live/2017/sep/05/the-great-british-bake-off-2017-episode-two-live|title= The Great British Bake Off 2017, episode two – as it happened|date=5 September 2017|work=Guardian|access-date=6 September 2017}}</ref>
