=== Episode 3: Bread ===
The bakers were instructed to make 12 [[teacake]]s in {{frac|2|3|4}} hours in the signature challenge. For the technical challenge, the bakers were tasked to make a [[cottage loaf]] in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were required to make a multicoloured bread sculpture with at least 3 colours using natural food colouring in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/live/2017/sep/12/the-great-british-bake-off-2017-episode-three-live|title=The Great British Bake Off 2017, episode three – as it happened|date=12 September 2017|work=Guardian|access-date=26 September 2017}}</ref>
